### Submit a new task
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test Submission",
  "description": "",
  "due": null,
  "recurrence": null,
  "listId": "default",
  "reminderOffsetMinutes": null,
  "completed": false,
  "subtasks": [],
  "isLongTerm": false,
  "startDate": null,
  "completedAt": null
}

### Submit a task without optional fields
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Call dentist"
}

### Submit a recurring daily task
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Morning standup",
  "description": "Daily team sync at 9 AM",
  "due": "2026-03-25T09:00",
  "recurrence": "daily",
  "listId": "default",
  "reminderOffsetMinutes": 30,
  "completed": false,
  "subtasks": []
}

### Submit a task with subtasks
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Project launch",
  "description": "Launch new feature to production",
  "due": "2026-03-28",
  "listId": "default",
  "completed": false,
  "subtasks": [
    {
      "id": "subtask-1",
      "title": "Code review",
      "completed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "subtask-2",
      "title": "Deploy to staging",
      "completed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "subtask-3",
      "title": "Smoke tests",
      "completed": false
    }
  ]
}

### Submit a long-term task
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn TypeScript",
  "description": "Complete TypeScript course and build a project",
  "isLongTerm": true,
  "startDate": "2026-03-24",
  "listId": "default",
  "completed": false
}
